.011773940345368938},{"w":0.37037034776475697,"y":0.78178963882086072,"x":0.074074080747251247,"h":0.011815012343450171,"text":"Leonardo da Vinci. Thank you for inviting me to your"},{"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.074074071771717653,"y":0.79788069073405765,"text":"home. I'm seventeen years old and I'm interested in","w":0.36419752332899302},{"x":0.074074082438285102,"text":"sport and film. I like music, parties and new friends!","w":0.36625512017144096,"y":0.81395348821311153,"h":0.011792194525151234},{"y":0.8343023260257294,"w":0.39094648573133683,"h":0.013081394896215404,"text":"Please write and tell me about yourself. How old are you?","x":0.076131696160394682},{"y":0.8502906981187528,"h":0.013131593797045871,"x":0.074074069502381906,"w":0.3930041164822049,"text":"What are you interested in? What happens on a typical"},{"w":0.37242797851562504,"y":0.86773255807745275,"h":0.011780785616001821,"text":"school day? What do you usually do at the weekend?","x":0.074074082792941767},{"x":0.076131686262769699,"y":0.888081395529003,"text":"See you in October.","h":0.01162790690711013,"w":0.13991769578721788},{"x":0.076131687934739442,"text":"Regards,","w":0.063786006503634987,"h":0.011627906907110019,"y":0.90843023278675494},{"y":0.92850272912850129,"w":0.059827732510036882,"text":"Lorenzo","h":0.0092736113951008559,"x":0.073995599759084443},{"y":0.95639534893016598,"x":0.067901234791937937,"text":"20","h":0.011627906907110019,"w":0.024691357082790799},{"text":"To: lorenzorossi17@supermail.com","y":0.11337209300962325,"w":0.24691357082790799,"x":0.52469136684942042,"h":0.011627906907110019},{"x":0.5246913622877416,"y":0.13069073780632989,"h":0.011773940345368938,"w":0.21810699462890626,"text":"From: joeandrews@chs.edu.uk"},{"text":"Subject: Re: Student exchange","h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.52469136083369494,"y":0.14678178974617406,"w":0.21810699462890626},{"x":0.52467055677556329,"y":0.16997776569770995,"w":0.078230904473198692,"h":0.010335165814290503,"text":"Hi Lorenzo"},{"text":"Thank you for your email. I'm also seventeen and I also","y":0.19034536889634868,"w":0.38065843370225694,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.52469136245271231},{"h":0.011815011969166678,"x":0.52263374859289291,"w":0.37860080295138887,"y":0.20639534892047595,"text":"like sports, music and the cinema. My favourite actor is"},{"w":0.34773661295572911,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.52263375693091441,"y":0.22370486639170006,"text":"Tom Holland. He's great in the Spider-Man movies."},{"y":0.242543170838319,"h":0.013343799058084693,"text":"On a typical school day, I get up at 7 a.m. (I hope that's OK","w":0.39711934407552085,"x":0.52469136007815176},{"x":0.52263375897553344,"y":0.26017441863946822,"h":0.011803603434300647,"text":"for you!) and I have a BIG breakfast. School starts at 8:30.","w":0.39506171332465279},{"text":"We have lunch at school at one o'clock. In the afternoon,","x":0.52469137326295101,"y":0.27616279094821017,"w":0.38683125813802088,"h":0.013083676528331867},{"w":0.32921810574001742,"x":0.52263374959912701,"text":"I go to the gym, do homework or relax at home.","y":0.29356357916318943,"h":0.011773940345368938},{"text":"At weekends, my friends and I always play football. (It's","w":0.37860080295138887,"h":0.013343799058084693,"x":0.52469137129522447,"y":0.31240188352622256},{"x":0.52469135279763057,"y":0.32994186055807284,"h":0.01162790690711013,"w":0.39711934407552085,"text":"my favourite sport. Do you like it?) On Saturday evenings,"},{"text":"I usually go out with friends to the cinema or to a party ...","x":0.52263374798759787,"y":0.34576138133639889,"w":0.4012345716688368,"h":0.011796758163667764},{"w":0.3045267401801216,"text":"or both. We can do all these things together.","h":0.011627906907110019,"x":0.52469136622681145,"y":0.36337209298539852},{"h":0.013088240541131668,"y":0.38226059635707288,"x":0.52469135898608299,"text":"Have a good trip. See you soon!","w":0.22839506361219619},{"text":"All the best,","h":0.015684975185424221,"y":0.40204123332311614,"x":0.52245967572556107,"w":0.092940733167860223},{"x":0.52057613181832518,"y":0.42296511625574729,"w":0.02880658467610675,"h":0.01162790690711013,"text":"Joe"},{"h":0.013343799058084804,"text":"4 Complete the WRITING FOCUS with the examples in","x":0.51440330213216134,"w":0.41563785129123265,"y":0.45486656212215804},{"w":0.30246914333767361,"h":0.011801321427900691,"text":"purple in the emails in Exercises 2 and 3.","x":0.54115226338774747,"y":0.47093023255661937},{"h":0.011627906907110019,"x":0.51851851769078694,"w":0.13786008199055988,"text":"WRITING FOCUS","y":0.49709302335292338},{"x":0.51646090688537849,"h":0.011773940345368938,"y":0.51883830464242331,"text":"An informal email","w":0.13786008199055988},{"text":"• Start the email with:","h":0.010288506886648507,"y":0.53767660913120996,"x":0.51440329384773653,"w":0.16666666666666663},{"h":0.013343799058084693,"x":0.52880659598360191,"y":0.55219780191622547,"w":0.22633743286132812,"text":"Dear or 'Hi + the person's name"},{"y":0.57103610677059125,"x":0.51440329707503452,"w":0.14403291490342884,"h":0.0090266875981162009,"text":"• Use contractions:"},{"x":0.524691358280721,"w":0.049382714165581598,"text":"1am =","y":0.58430232562942841,"h":0.010281661990299007},{"y":0.58284883712640356,"text":"2","w":0.016460905075073251,"x":0.59876543208180499,"h":0.0087209301803324868},{"x":0.6759837227453358,"text":"It is = 3","w":0.053530315823025143,"h":0.013796729981618516,"y":0.58231315885849089},{"text":"• Useful phrases at the beginning of the email:","w":0.34773661295572922,"x":0.51440330425601721,"y":0.60164835149545093,"h":0.011773940345368827},{"h":0.013343799058084804,"w":0.21810699462890626,"y":0.61616954438451488,"text":"I'm ... (your exchange partner)","x":0.52469136064165112},{"x":0.52880659062017743,"h":0.013104212714514119,"y":0.62936046512456678,"w":0.18930040147569449,"text":"Thank you\/Thanks for your"},{"x":0.51234568097596989,"h":0.01162790690711013,"w":0.12551439921061192,"text":"• Ask qu